<v Clayton Gentry>So when we're at our healthiest operation, this is the point that should be the messiest.

187
00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:42.540
<v Clayton Gentry>This is where most of the disagreement, most of the debate happens.

188
00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:49.620
