189
00:14:49.980 --> 00:14:54.500
<v Clayton Gentry>So we really try to pull forward that messiness as much as we can.

190
00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:59.560
<v Clayton Gentry>In keeping with the shape up philosophy, we will draft what we call a pitch.

191
00:14:59.760 --> 00:15:00.880
<v Clayton Gentry>It could be lengthy.

