00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:24.080
<v Clayton Gentry>We don't fit the timeline around the feature.

199
00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:30.740
<v Clayton Gentry>We call this scope hammering, which is verbiage that we picked up from the shape up philosophy.

