00:16:59.680 --> 00:17:05.080
<v Clayton Gentry>effectively in the community and generally to participate in a community, I have found to be

221
00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:12.400
<v Clayton Gentry>a strong signal, both of technical wherewithal, but also emotional intelligence, which obviously

