275
00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:30.100
<v Clayton Gentry>that were each running their own very specific application.

276
00:21:30.520 --> 00:21:33.380
<v Clayton Gentry>We had one service for caching data.

277
00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:37.180
<v Clayton Gentry>We had one service for decrypting outbound requests

278
00:21:37.180 --> 00:21:39.060
<v Clayton Gentry>that included sensitive data,

279
00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:41.040
<v Clayton Gentry>like an API key or an access token,

