00:23:24.780 --> 00:23:29.360
<v Clayton Gentry>or not, I think we had a bug one day and I was pulling my hair out trying to fix this obscure

318
00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:35.440
<v Clayton Gentry>issue along this Postgres replication chain instead of shipping a feature that would have

319
00:23:35.440 --> 00:23:39.720
