00:28:12.460 --> 00:28:28.800
<v Clayton Gentry>So I have a lot of respect for Sam and his philosophy around that. And I try to act that out. I find that creating that space begets calmness and that calmness is prerequisite to good aim on where you're going. I like Sam Corcos a lot. I'm listening to him a lot lately.

